<li>Cracked or pulled-back flashing at parapet walls, curbs and rooftop units</li>
<li>Clogged drains, scuppers or gutters, or staining on exterior walls below them</li>
<li>Rust, loose fasteners or failing sealant on metal roof panels</li>
