<li><strong>Written estimate with options.</strong> Where it makes sense, we present more than one path, such as a repair now with a coating later, or a full replacement, so you can plan around budget cycles.</li>
<li><strong>Scheduling around your business.</strong> We coordinate work hours, staging areas, crane or material deliveries and access points with you in advance to limit disruption to customers, employees and tenants.</li>
